  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in an RNA-only multiprofile model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 and F1 of 0.6283. The results suggest transformer aggregation may contribute to performance in RNA-only settings, though its relative impact compared to other aggregation methods or encoder choices remains uncertain without direct comparison."
